  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 22b0b1b750c4e7e44b6855ab0e4c118a, type: 3}
  introDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d71e962d6af69bf4f8e4449472844fc2, type: 2}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    earlyDaysAnswer: The census office on the third block. I file at the same time
      each evening.
    midDaysAnswer: The district archive. Some mortality records needed updating.
    finalDaysAnswer: I walk certain routes. I have them memorized.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: Home. I have been home since morning. I do not leave
      without a reason. Today there was no reason.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: Work. Everything normal. No unusual files. A completely
      routine day.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Visiting a friend. She is very well. I was with her
      until just now.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  - question: Have you been experiencing any strange symptoms lately?
    earlyDaysAnswer: No. I track my health carefully. Nothing unusual.
    midDaysAnswer: Some difficulty sleeping. But I use the time well. I review old
      entries.
    finalDaysAnswer: I have been remembering things more clearly than usual. It is
      not always comfortable.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: I feel completely fine. I always feel completely fine.
      Nothing changes in me.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: No sleep issues. I sleep exactly eight hours. I track
      it.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Nothing. My memory is normal. I do not remember more
      than I should.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  - question: Who do you live with?
    earlyDaysAnswer: Alone. I prefer it. Shared spaces complicate the records.
    midDaysAnswer: Just myself. It has been that way for a long time.
    finalDaysAnswer: I live alone. I have always lived alone.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: My husband. He is home right now. He does not like to
      go out.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: A roommate. She stays in her room mostly. We do not talk
      much. It is fine.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Someone. They have been with me for years. You would
      know them if you saw them. Probably.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  idleBarks:
    earlyDays:
    - I have recorded every resident in this district. Some of them do not know that.
    - You are the fourth officer to work this post. The third one was quieter.
    - I keep a column for people who look right through me. It is longer than you
      would think.
    midDays:
    - The list is shorter than it was. That is normal in an emergency. I have read
      about this.
    - A lot of people are getting very honest lately. It makes my job easier.
    - I wrote your name down. Do not worry. It is only for the registry.
    finalDays:
    - Almost everyone I have recorded in this district is still here. Almost everyone.
    - The numbers do not lie. People do, but numbers do not.
    - I never forget a face. It is not a skill I chose. It just happens.
    uncannyEarlyDays: []
    uncannyMidDays: []
    uncannyFinalDays: []
  IDNumber: 7070787
